WEBVTT

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.220
Here we go! All units, spread out!

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:52.820
All units in position!

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.220
Okay! Now!

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.550
--Roger!
--Roger!

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:07.460
Here goes! All units, charge!

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:08.790
Go!

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:21.220
Attack on the Libertad

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:44.190
Okay! It looks like we've
wiped out the first batch!

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:46.750
Let's move on to crushing the next group!

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:50.390
These things are playing dead again?!

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.990
Oh no! It's going to
self-destruct! Damn it!

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.010
That's not like you!

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:06.570
About damn time, Gutsy Girl!
Took you long enough!

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.420
All units! Change of formation!

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:13.550
Martha on the right wing!
Ermy on the left wing!

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:15.450
Lavinia will bring up the rear!

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:17.510
--Right!
--Let's do it!

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:27.160
I will stop you... Brother!

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:46.950
1800 seconds until self-destruct.
All hands, evacuate immediately.

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:50.290
I'm coming for you... Emily...

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.400
What's happening with the enemy ship?!

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:04.570
The Deague ship remains
on its pursuit course!

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:09.740
The TUMORs appear to be preventing
the Strains from getting near!

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.380
Can't we lose it?!

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:15.050
No, sir! We don't have
enough time to accelerate!

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:19.150
Barrage the enemy with
the rearward cannons!

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.990
Fire!

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:22.990
Cannon fire from the Libertad!

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.480
All units, evade!

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:32.990
Did we get it?!

00:03:39.270 --> 00:03:42.870
Continue cannon fire!
Shoot it down at all costs!

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:55.960
Evasive maneuvers!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.790
35 degrees downward!

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:02.030
We won't make it in time!
15 seconds to enemy ship collision!

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:04.720
All hands, brace for impact!

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:28.120
Enemy ship collision in port quarter block!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.660
All nearby crewmembers, evacuate!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.210
This can't be happening...

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:34.860
The Libertad...

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:36.230
This can't be happening!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.740
There you are, Ralph Werec!

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.790
Out of my way!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:16.740
Gutsy Girl! Quit sitting there!
Go after him!

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.030
Go finish things once and for all!

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:26.870
The Engine Block is destroyed!
We're unable to move!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.230
Enemy intrusion from Starboard Block D24!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.990
Lowering defense barriers!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:45.260
Unable to stop the TUMOR intrusion!

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:48.700
Engine restoration will take 20,
no, 30 minutes!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:52.030
At this rate, we'll be caught
in the enemy ship's self-destruct!

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:55.640
So this is it...

00:05:55.640 --> 00:06:01.150
All hands, prepare to evacuate ship!
Ready the escape pods, quickly!

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:03.420
Not so fast!

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:07.590
I ask that you save abandoning ship
for only after I fail at my task.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:13.030
Task? You're not thinking of-

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:15.790
If that Deague woman
is telling the truth,

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.230
we have 10 minutes
until it self-destructs.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:21.130
With me on the job,
it'll be no problem at all!

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:22.130
But...

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:25.140
Once Melchi says something,
there's no changing his mind.

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:26.760
Shut up, Carmichael!

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:29.770
I will come, too.

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:33.480
Don't slow me down, now!

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:37.680
900 seconds until self-destruct.
All hands, evacuate immediately.

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:50.590
Brother! Where are you?!

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:17.790
Damn! This is bad!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:20.960
I need five more transfusion packs!
No, eight more units!

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.190
Yes, sir!

00:07:23.360 --> 00:07:26.000
Misery! Hurry and prep
the cardiac massage!

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:26.970
Yes, sir!

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:29.570
Becky! You go assist
the emergency team in Block E!

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:31.000
Understood!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.410
Damn you, Ralph Werec!

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.740
Brother...

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:41.740
What is it?

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:52.220
Hurry! The TUMORs have
supposedly made it to Area 15!

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:06.090
No... No... No more!

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:10.940
And just where are you running off to?

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:14.440
Be gentle! Can't you see she's scared?

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:17.320
Are you okay?

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:22.340
D-don't worry! We're just gonna
take you somewhere safe!

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.390
Emily!

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:49.680
D-damn it...

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.760
Sara!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.870
Talk about incredible timing...

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:19.650
Sara!

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:22.210
Sara! Sara!

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:24.910
Emily... Thank goodness
you're all right...

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:51.210
Emily...

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:57.320
Looking at her like this,
she seems like any ordinary girl...

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:00.650
--What could be special about her?
--Yeah...

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:03.550
Dickon!

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:11.690
B- Brother...

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:32.350
110 seconds until self-destruct.
All hands, evacuate immediately.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:35.390
Wow, we made it sooner than I expected!

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:37.920
Maybe it's because we had
someone to show the way?

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.160
--Quit joking around.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:42.230
There's no time! Please hurry!
--Quit joking around.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:46.760
Don't be in such a rush.
We're still fine. I got it covered.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:54.770
45 seconds until self-destruct.
All hands, evacuate immediately.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:56.400
Yes! Here we are!

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:01.880
See? I told you there
was no need to panic!

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.820
With me in charge, everything will be OK!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:10.220
600 seconds until self-destruct.
Disarmament not possible.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:12.220
What?! It reset?!

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:14.390
How can this be?!

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:16.960
No! I have no idea-

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.860
I-it couldn't have been!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:22.700
Impressive work, Ralph Werec...

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:27.170
S-screw this! I don't want to die here!

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:28.970
Hey, you!

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.310
Damn it!

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:35.710
That rifle won't open a barrier
meant to seal the bridge.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.750
More importantly, there's still
something we can do.

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:39.920
Something we can do?

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:43.510
Yeah. Something we can do
because we're here.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:49.360
560 seconds until self-destruct.
Disarmament not possible.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:58.840
This... is all his fault, too...

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:01.940
If only I hadn't met him, I'd be-

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:04.240
My life would be-

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.840
Damn him!

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:17.660
He even activated the spare units?!

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:20.960
My ID code! They think I'm the enemy!

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:23.500
S-stay away!

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:27.270
I'm not the enemy! I'm-

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:29.060
Stop! Stay away!

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:33.070
S-stop!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.290
Give Emily back.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:55.490
Stop this, Brother! Emily doesn't-

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:58.700
Give Emily back!

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.220
Brother...

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:16.080
The enemy ship!

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.280
What?! How...

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:19.820
...can this be?!

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:22.520
We failed to disarm
the self-destruct mechanism.

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.920
We're going to pull away from
the Libertad as far as possible!

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:28.160
Wait, you two!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:31.000
I don't know how big
of an explosion it'll be,

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.370
but we need to avoid as much damage
to the Libertad as possible.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:37.470
Lucky for us, we can do this
since we were on the bridge.

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:39.670
Well, I guess it's not lucky for us.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.140
Indeed.

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:46.140
Look at you trying
to be all cool, Melchi...

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:48.580
Shut up, Carmichael.

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:53.950
Instructor... Melchi...

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:00.110
Come, Emily...

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:05.320
Come here, Emily!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:13.040
That's-

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:22.010
Don't tell me... it's that?!

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:24.320
That's right, Brother.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:29.720
That's the other Emily.
My irreplaceable partner now.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:33.130
The other Emily...

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:38.560
I see... So that's how it was...

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.470
Now come here, Emily!

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:50.280
You and her! And then the three
of us will return to your home!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:54.780
And then it will all be over.
You don't need to stay here.

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:58.980
You don't need to let
these humans use you.

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:02.590
It'll all be... It'll all be...

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:03.790
It'll all be...

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:06.630
It'll all be over!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.320
So move out of the way, Sara!

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:14.030
I told you before!

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:17.020
I'll kill anyone who stands in
my way, no matter who it is!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.270
I see.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:27.580
No!

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.950
No more!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.420
Emily...

00:15:31.420 --> 00:15:33.690
I'm not going home!

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:37.360
I'm staying here!
By Sara's side, forever!

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:40.330
What?! Why?!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:45.060
Why would you do that?!
I've done all this to grant your wish!

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:48.400
Are you going to kill a lot?
Like back then?

00:15:56.110 --> 00:16:01.550
I... we... never wanted that!

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:04.040
You never wanted it?

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:08.120
What nonsense...

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:11.720
After all that sadness...
that pain... that suffering...

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:13.750
We've come this far...

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:18.100
And yet... And yet...

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:20.130
Why?!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:22.430
No, it isn't like that...

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:26.370
You must've hated humans!
You must've wanted revenge!

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:30.740
You say you never wanted this?!
Don't be stupid!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:32.740
We don't-

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:35.240
Emily...

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:41.950
Come here, anyway, Emily...

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:43.050
Come!

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:49.950
Sara!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:06.110
She's right... It's not like that...
No one wants this...

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:08.550
No one ever wanted it!

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:11.650
What would you...
What would you know?!

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:16.890
I know! I know her pain,
and her sadness!

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:20.030
But... But...

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:22.360
You've got it all wrong, Brother!

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:30.800
They were great students...

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:35.140
No, they were all a bunch
of smartasses this year.

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:48.450
Don't be stupid! No one would
be happy to see you do this!

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:52.250
"I won't let anyone else die!"
Those are Gutsy Girl's words!

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:58.030
Brother... It's time to stop this.

00:17:58.030 --> 00:18:01.430
Be quiet! Be quiet! Be quiet!

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:27.830
The surviving TUMORs
are starting to regroup.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.060
Let's head back!

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:32.520
Yeah! Let's wipe out
the remaining TUMORs!

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:42.140
We have to protect the place
we're returning to!

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:54.110
Why?! Why do you blame me?!
Why do you torment me?!

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:57.950
Brother!

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.450
I'm-

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:14.610
Sara...

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:15.870
I'm okay...

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:21.110
Becky. Dickon. Take care of her for me.

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:22.580
Eh?

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.510
Please.

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:34.050
Don't worry. I will be back.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:46.630
Sara...

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:06.590
Sara...

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:18.690
We're tired of being sad...
of being lonely...

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:23.680
That's why... I'm going to end it all!

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:25.340
Right here, right now!

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:35.670
My brother has it all wrong!
That's why I will stop him!

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:40.230
On the next Soukou
no Strain: "Last Waltz"

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:42.070
Let's go together, Emily...
